  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0072","literal","When less than one second, leaf-discard is not used; same below.","When less than one second, discard and do not use; the same below.","不足一秒葉不用 is the calendrical discard formula: remainders under one second are thrown away unused. 'Leaf-discard is not used' misreads 葉 as 'leaf' and reverses the sense; 'discard and do not use' restores the meaning supported by the calculation context and the idiomatic rendering.","high","applied"],
    ["s0073","literal","In all the sagitta obtained is eighty seconds; for the remaining degrees each follows the above method, seeking down to the sagitta, to serve as the root of yellow-and-red mutual seeking and their inner and outer degrees.","In all the sagitta obtained is eighty-two seconds; for the remaining degrees each follows the above method, seeking down to the sagitta, to serve as the root of yellow-and-red mutual seeking and their inner and outer degrees.","矢度八十二秒 is eighty-two seconds; the literal's 'eighty seconds' omits 二 and conflicts with the idiomatic 82″ and the same figure in s0091.","high","applied"],
    ["s0091","literal","Within subtract ecliptic sagitta eighty seconds; remainder sixty degrees eighty-six minutes sixty-eight as small chord of yellow and red paths.","Within subtract ecliptic sagitta eighty-two seconds; remainder sixty degrees eighty-six minutes sixty-eight as small chord of yellow and red paths.","黃道矢八十二秒 is eighty-two seconds; the literal's 'eighty seconds' omits 二 and disagrees with the idiomatic 82″ and the sagitta stated in s0073.","high","applied"]
  ],
